Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series designed to help you master running your business.

In this video, we break down how to accept payments for new bookings using the Fieldd mobile app. From cash to card to digital payments, this video shows how easy it is to manage transactions in the fieldd.

With Fieldd’s built-in payment tools, your service business can process secure, contactless payments and get paid on the spot, no extra hardware required.

fieldd makes job payments fast, simple, and organized.

